[ext_resource type="Texture2D" path="res://assets/bonelight/ui/spells/sleet-runes-ice.png" id="3_icon"]

; Runes of rime cast the way the player faces, aimed at nothing (scripts/SleetRunes.cs).
;
; BaseDamage is ONE RUNE, on each body it strikes. BaseProjectileCount is the runes one cooldown casts -
; one after another, 0.05 s apart, each along the facing at its release. BaseRange is how far a rune
; flies (px). Speed is SleetRunes.BaseSpeed (640 px/s) plus the ProjectileSpeed line below (Effect 8,
; px/s); Pierce (Effect 1) is how many more bodies a rune passes through before it is spent.
;
; Written out in full so Player.EnsureRelevantLevelUps generates nothing of its own: every level adds
; damage, even levels take a small cooldown step (it is already quick) and add a rune (2, 4, 8) or
; a pierce (6), 3 adds a pierce, 5 speed and 7 reach. Level 8: 5 runes of 16 every 0.50 s, passing
; through 3 bodies each, at 720 px/s over 440 px.

